0%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.9pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.7pt\">○</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.9pt\"> 기술과 지역문화의 융합과 디자인적 사고를 통한 창의적 역량 강화 및 지역의 특색 있는 창업 캠프 운영</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.9pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.7pt\">○</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.9pt\"> 지역 순회를 통한 권역별로 창업 캠프를 진행함으로서 지역 전체의 창업 붐 조성 및 NEST 활동 저변 확대</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 캠프 일정</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.7pt\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp; </font><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○&nbsp;일&nbsp;&nbsp; 정 : 2013년 10월 31일(목) - 11.2(토) 2박3일 금오산 호텔</span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.7pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 대&nbsp; &nbsp; 상 : 금오공과대학교 학생 전원</span></font></strong></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.7pt\">&nbsp;</span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.7pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#ff007f\"><span> (창업관련 아이디어에 관심이 있는 학생이면 누구나 참가가능)</span></font></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"> <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">○ 참가인원 : 대구,경북지역 대학생 30명이상 </span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 최 : 중소기업청/창업진흥원</span></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 관 : 영남대학교 산학협력단/NEST</span></font></strong></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">-------------------------------------------</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">참가를 희망하는 학생은 신청서 작성후 메일 부탁합니다.</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;기타 궁금한 사항은 벤처창업관(구 이오스관) 313호 </font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;054)478-6944&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><a href=\"mailto:wndbs75@kumoh.ac.kr\">wndbs75@kumoh.ac.kr</a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; 묻의 요망</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong> <font color=\"#ff007f\">10월 24일(목) 까지 이메일로 접수 </font>바랍니다.</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13.7pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; 학생여러분의 많은 참여 부탁합니다.</span></strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
